#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "516_Kiryu"
msgid "Use <Action:Button_LS_Up@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Down@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Left@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Right@Cabaret> to control where you look. This is your chance to feast your eyes on her beauty."
msgstr "Usa <Action:Button_LS_Up@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Down@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Left@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Right@Cabaret> para mover tu mirada. Esta es tu oportunidad para deleitar tus ojos con su belleza."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "528_Kiryu"
msgid "Press <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret>when you want to focus intently on one of her features. Holding down <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret>allows you to focus your gaze."
msgstr "Presiona <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret> en el lugar donde deseas dirigir tu \"poderosa\" mirada. Si mantienes presionado <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret>, la mirada se enfocará más y será aún más intensa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "540_Kiryu"
msgid "Her reaction will change depending on what you focus on."
msgstr "Su reacción cambiará dependiendo en lo que te enfoques."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "564_Kiryu"
msgid "(Maybe her eyes...)"
msgstr "(Tal vez sus ojos...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "576_Kiryu"
msgid "(Those luscious lips...)"
msgstr "(Esos labios exquisitos...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "588_Kiryu"
msgid "(Those beautiful nails...)"
msgstr "(Esas hermosas uñas...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "600_Kiryu"
msgid "(What kind of shoes is she wearing?)"
msgstr "(¿Qué tipo de zapatos estará usando...?)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "612_Kiryu"
msgid "(Maybe her hair...)"
msgstr "(Tal vez su pelo...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "624_Kiryu"
msgid "(Maybe her chest...)"
msgstr "(Tal vez su pecho...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "636_Kiryu"
msgid "(What part of a woman do I look at? Hmm...)"
msgstr "(¿Qué parte de una mujer miraré? Mmm...)"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "648_Kiryu"
msgid "Her eyes. A woman's personality can really shine through depending on the kind of makeup she uses."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "660_Maya"
msgid "That's true. And the eyes are the part of the face that stands out the most."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "672_Kiryu"
msgid "The shape of a woman's eyebrows is important, too. They can really change how a woman looks."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "684_Maya"
msgid "Heh. You've really spent a lot of time looking at women's faces, haven't you? I should work harder on my makeup."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "696_Kiryu"
msgid "I look at a woman's mouth. When her lips are a little moist, it can be incredibly sexy."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "708_Maya"
msgid "Her lips, huh? You really pay attention to details."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "720_Kiryu"
msgid "The shape of a woman's lips changes depending on her mood. And when a beautiful woman smiles, she can be radiant."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "732_Maya"
msgid "Hehe. I think maybe you're taking things a little too far. But I'll try to focus on my lips a bit more from now on."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "744_Kiryu"
msgid "I look at a woman's hands. I want to see what her nails look like."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "756_Maya"
msgid "Nails, huh? They can really stand out sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "768_Kiryu"
msgid "Nails are really just an accessory. If a woman puts effort into her nails, you know she's really fashionable."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "780_Maya"
msgid "You sure know what you're talking about. I should've guessed."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "792_Kiryu"
msgid "I look at her shoes first."
msgstr "Primero, miraré sus zapatos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "804_Maya"
msgid "Ha! That's surprising!"
msgstr "¡Ja! ¡Eso es sorprendente!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "816_Kiryu"
msgid "You can tell how much someone cares about their appearance by looking at their shoes, you know."
msgstr "¿Sabes? Se puede saber como alguien le importa la  apariencia mirando sus zapatos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "828_Kiryu"
msgid "And you can guess how much money they have, too."
msgstr "También, puedes adivinar cuanto dinero tienen."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "840_Maya"
msgid "You're right! You really know your stuff!"
msgstr "¡Tienes razón! ¡Realmente sabes lo que haces!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "852_Kiryu"
msgid "I look at a woman's hair."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "864_Maya"
msgid "Hmm? Her hairstyle? Why?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "876_Kiryu"
msgid "Women wear different clothes every day, but their hairstyle stays for a long time. It's the easiest way to see their fashion sense."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "888_Maya"
msgid "Oh! I never looked at it that way. I think I just learned something!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "900_Kiryu"
msgid "I look at a woman's chest."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "912_Maya"
msgid "I should've known. Men look at that kind of thing first, don't they?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "924_Kiryu"
msgid "Well, that's the reason so many clothes are low-cut."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "936_Maya"
msgid "I suppose you're right. Asking a man for advice about how to prepare for fashion shoots wasn't the best idea."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "948_Maya"
msgid "Um, hello? What are you looking at?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "960_Kiryu"
msgid "Hmm? Oh, sorry... I get a little nervous when you're watching me look at you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "972_Maya"
msgid "Hahaha! I never thought of you as the shy type!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "984_Kiryu"
msgid "I just don't like the idea of ogling women."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "996_Maya"
msgid "We're talking about modeling. It's not that big a deal, is it? You're more innocent than I thought. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1008_Kiryu"
msgid "(She's got strong eyes...)"
msgstr "(Tiene ojos fuertes...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1020_Kiryu"
msgid "(Her mouth is very shapely...)"
msgstr "(Su boca está muy bien formada...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "1032_Kiryu"
msgid "(Her hands are nice...)"
msgstr "(Sus manos son bonitas....)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "1044_Kiryu"
msgid "(It's hard to see with her dress, but her legs?)"
msgstr "(Es difícil verla con su vestido, pero... ¿sus piernas?)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "1056_Kiryu"
msgid "(She's got such pretty hair...)"
msgstr "(Ella tiene un lindo cabello...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "1068_Kiryu"
msgid "(Could it be her chest?)"
msgstr "(¿Podría ser su pecho?)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "1080_Kiryu"
msgid "(What could he have complimented her on?)"
msgstr "(¿Por qué podría haberla felicitado?)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1092_Kiryu"
msgid "Was it your eyes? They're so strong and defiant."
msgstr "¿Fueron tus ojos? Son muy fuertes y desafiantes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1104_Maya"
msgid "That's right! I'm impressed. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡Le atinaste! Estoy muy impresionada. <Color:Default>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1116_Maya"
msgid "They were going for a serious look today, and he said he loved how strong my eyes looked."
msgstr "Iban a por un look serio y dijo que le encantaba lo fuerte que se veían mis ojos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1128_Kiryu"
msgid "Ah. What kind of expression did you use? Could you show me?"
msgstr "Ah. ¿Y qué tipo de expresión usaste? ¿Me lo podrías enseñar?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1140_Maya"
msgid "Sorry! I only turn it on while I'm working. You'll have to wait until the photos are published."
msgstr "¡Discúlpame! Solo lo enseño mientras estoy trabajando. Así que solo te toca esperar hasta que se publiquen las fotos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "1152_Kiryu"
msgid "Was it your mouth? A good smile must be important in modeling."
msgstr "¿Será tu boca? Tener una linda sonrisa debe ser importante en el modelaje."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "1164_Maya"
msgid "Nope! I do get compliments on my smile, but today they were going for a more serious look."
msgstr "¡Nope! Me elogian por mi sonrisa, pero hoy me vieron de una manera más seria."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "1176_Maya"
msgid "The correct answer was... my eyes! He said they looked strong and beautiful."
msgstr "La respuesta correcta era... ¡Mis ojos! Me dijeron que me veía decidida y linda."

